# This file intentionally only points at the root .env.example.
#
# It used to be a byte-for-byte duplicate of ../../.env.example (same 1134
# bytes), so every config change had to be made twice or the two silently
# diverged. The root file is the single source of truth. See modify.md section 3.
#
# Copy the root template instead:
#     cp .env.example .env
# The app loads .env from the repository root regardless of your CWD.
